Output lockvet-demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1040
Set Height 480
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Shell "bash"

Hide
Type "cd /tmp/fd-demo && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "# dependabot just merged a 'patch' bump — what actually changed?"
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "lockvet HEAD~1"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Sleep 3.5s
